Create CSS Module styles for {{componentName}}.

**Condition**: Only execute if {{stylingApproach}} is 'css-modules'

**Input**: Read STYLING_SPEC.md

**Output**: Create `{{componentPath}}/{{componentName}}.module.css`

**CSS Module Best Practices**:

```css
/* Component root */
.container {
  /* Layout */
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-md);

  /* Spacing */
  padding: var(--space-lg);

  /* Visual */
  background-color: var(--color-bg);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);

  /* Transitions */
  transition: all var(--transition-base);
}

/* Element modifiers */
.container[data-variant="primary"] {
  background-color: var(--color-primary);
  color: white;
}

.container[data-size="small"] {
  padding: var(--space-sm);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
}

.container[data-size="large"] {
  padding: var(--space-xl);
  font-size: 1.125rem;
}

/* Child elements */
.header {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--color-text);
}

.content {
  flex: 1;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
}

.footer {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  gap: var(--space-sm);
  padding-top: var(--space-md);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
}

/* Interactive elements */
.button {
  padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
  background-color: var(--color-primary);
  color: white;
  border: none;
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all var(--transition-fast);
}

.button:hover:not(:disabled) {
  opacity: 0.9;
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}

.button:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

.button:active:not(:disabled) {
  transform: translateY(0);
}

.button:disabled {
  opacity: 0.5;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}

/* State variations */
.container[data-loading="true"] {
  opacity: 0.6;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.container[data-error="true"] {
  border-color: var(--color-error);
}

/* Responsive design */
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .container {
    padding: var(--space-md);
  }

  .header {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px) {
  .container {
    max-width: 720px;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1025px) {
  .container {
    max-width: 960px;
  }
}

/* Accessibility */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .container,
  .button {
    transition: none;
  }
}

@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  /* Dark mode overrides if needed beyond CSS variables */
}

/* Print styles */
@media print {
  .container {
    box-shadow: none;
    border: 1px solid black;
  }
}
```

**Key Patterns**:

1. **Use data attributes for variants**:
   ```tsx
   <div className={styles.container} data-variant="primary" data-size="large">
   ```

2. **Compose with multiple classes**:
   ```tsx
   <div className={`${styles.container} ${styles.special}`}>
   ```

3. **Always use design tokens** (CSS variables):
   ✅ `color: var(--color-primary);`
   ❌ `color: #3b82f6;`

4. **Progressive enhancement**:
   - Base styles work everywhere
   - Enhanced styles for modern browsers

5. **Accessibility first**:
   - Color contrast
   - Focus states
   - Motion preferences

